{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4e15cf68aad68938","name":"Lightsaber Construction","source":{"id":"source:reference-4e15cf68aad68938","title":"Lightsaber Construction","revision":24950,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:00:41Z","sha256":"4f35b67f4dd617073359e3064d3717d8afa52c84fad83e4e98a237581aff231c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24950","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lightsaber%20Construction&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4e15cf68aad68938","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can build a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," if you have at least seven Heroic Levels, as well as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Lightsabers)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Lightsabers)"}," feats. You must spend 1,500 credits to obtain the basic components, and 24 uninterrupted hours constructing the weapon (you can build a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double-Bladed Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double-Bladed_Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:eedee53b782242fa"}," instead, but the cost for components increases to 3,000 credits). At the end of this time, make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check (you can't ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 20"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_20"}," on this check). If the check succeeds, you complete the Lightsaber's construction. If the check fails, you may spend another 24 hours dismantling and rebuilding the flawed weapon.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," is constructed, you may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to attune it (a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},"). From that point on, you gain a +1 bonus on all attack rolls made with your Self-Built ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". No one else who wields the weapon gains this bonus.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," class table includes \"Build Lightsaber\" at 7th level. Does this mean that only a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," can build a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},"?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," No. As noted in Lightsaber Construction, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," can be built by any character who has at least seven Heroic Levels, has the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," Feat, and is proficient with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},". The entry in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," class is just meant to be a reminder of this fact.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Advanced Lightsaber Construction"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["For some Jedi and Sith, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," is not just a weapon; it is a personalized emblem of one's life and philosophy. Similarly, some players may wish to customize their Jedi hero's Lightsaber to reflect the character's philosophy and fighting style, beyond the basic Lightsaber Construction rules found above. This following section includes a wealth of new options for players and Gamemasters looking to customize their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," to better fit the characters who wield them. The Advanced Lightsaber Construction process begins when a hero reaches 7th level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ol","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["First, the player or Gamemaster must decide what kind to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," to build. The standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," is the most common ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," in the galaxy, and it is not only the easiest to build but also requires no special training to use effectively in combat (besides the standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Lightsabers)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Lightsabers)"}," Feat)."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Once a particular kind of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," has been selected, the next step is to choose a Lightsaber Crystal. Any character can build a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," from an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Adegan Crystal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Adegan_Crystal"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ilum Crystal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ilum_Crystal","referenceId":"reference:d330f9b088faed5d"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Synthetic Crystal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Synthetic_Crystal"},"; the default assumption is that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," (and other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},"-wielding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Traditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Traditions","referenceId":"reference:da4e2621bc8ff060"},") have ample access to these Lightsaber Crystals and need perform no special quest to obtain one. However, if you wish to use a Lightsaber Crystal of another kind, the character may need to undergo a special adventure to obtain the Lightsaber Crystal."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Once the desired Lightsaber Crystal has been chosen and obtained, the next step is to choose any special Lightsaber Accessories or Lightsaber Modifications to be made. With that in mind, the Advanced Lightsaber Construction can begin."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Special Lightsaber Crystals and Lightsaber Accessories can modify the DC to construct the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". When Advanced Lightsaber Construction begins, using the standard rules above, applying these modifiers to the standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check DC before the check is made (the base DC is determined by the type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," being constructed, per the table blow)."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Once the Lightsaber is constructed, you may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to attune it (a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},"). From that point on, the creator of this Self-Built Lightsaber gains the benefit of the used Lightsaber Crystal."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Base Construction DCs"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LIGHTSABER\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BUILD DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Double-Bladed Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double-Bladed_Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:eedee53b782242fa"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Ruleboo